          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 566,
            "text": "theorem average_error_bound {F : ProfileHistories.Field} (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F D.carrier)\n    {p : Point} (hp : p ∈ D.carrier) {Λ b B : ℝ}\n    (hbound : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, |Λ * (F (t * p.1, p.2) - b)| ≤ B) :\n    |Λ * (average F p - b)| ≤ B"
          }
